@name squad info
@type slash
@parent See and set which squad somebody is in.
@description Somebody's squad and how many events they have hosted. Defaults to you.
@option user:user:Who to look up.
$ephemeral
$squadInfo[$message[user]]
$if[$json[inSquad]==yes]
<@$json[discordId]> is in **$json[squad;label]**, holding $json[squad;roles].
$else
<@$json[discordId]> is not in a squad.
$endif
Events hosted: **$json[hosted]**$if[$json[hostedLive]>0; ($json[hostedLive] on now)]
---
@name squad set
@type slash
@description Move somebody into a squad. Their old squad role is taken off.
@option user:user:Who to move.:required
@option squad:string:Which squad they join.:required:from squads
$ephemeral
$onlyIf[$aesuAllowed[squad]==yes;$if[$aesuRole[squad]==;You do not have permission to do that.;Only $aesuRole[squad] can change squads.]]
$var[r;$squadSet[$message[user];$message[squad]]]
$onlyIf[$var[r]==ok;$json[error]]
<@$json[discordId]> is in **$json[squad;label]**, holding $json[squad;roles].
---
@name squad clear
@type slash
@description Take somebody out of their squad.
@option user:user:Who to remove.:required
$ephemeral
$onlyIf[$aesuAllowed[squad]==yes;$if[$aesuRole[squad]==;You do not have permission to do that.;Only $aesuRole[squad] can change squads.]]
$var[r;$squadClear[$message[user]]]
$onlyIf[$var[r]==ok;$json[error]]
$if[$json[was]!=]
<@$json[discordId]> was taken out of **$json[was]**.
$else
<@$json[discordId]> was not in a squad. Any leftover squad roles have been cleared.
$endif
---
@name squad roster
@type slash
@description How many people are in each squad.
$ephemeral
$var[r;$squadRoster]
$onlyIf[$var[r]==ok;$json[error]]
$addContainer[roster]
$addTextDisplay[$jsonList[squads;{role} · **{count}** member(s)]]
$addSeparator
$addTextDisplay[Not in a squad: **$json[unassigned]**]
$closeContainer
